{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PlinkIdle is a chill idle game in which randomized chaos meets rewarding progression. Players drop balls in stages to watch them bounce through thematic peg boards. Each stage has its own aesthetic, audio, and unlocks, from a rainy sky to neon madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn coins, collect balls, unlock upgrades, complete achievements, and advance through the stages at your own pace. The deeper you go, the more chaos (and beauty) erupts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please wishlist and follow us if you're interested in receiving updates about this game as it evolves! We're actively still polishing and developing this project to make it super rewarding. <br><br>Thank you so much for playing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684530?t=1747943289","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/69e0b7378753bb1903556dc978cb28173be8990c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747943289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/edacf7a6e853a5ef3b21ad580c87529c3cd89d0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747943289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684530/edacf7a6e853a5ef3b21ad580c87529c3cd89d0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747943289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thematic stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Idle, incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lucky buffs and drops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prestige</p></li></ul></p><br><